        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we produce and distribute software options, control upgrades, hardware accessories, and replacement parts for our machine tool product lines, and we provide operator training and support services to our customers.",
        "start_character": 7746,
        "end_character": 7973
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-002512",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-002512-02a06f2977e01a1e",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also own additional patents covering new technologies that we have acquired or developed, and that we are planning to incorporate into our control systems or products in the future.",
        "start_character": 48978,
        "end_character": 49162
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-002512",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-002512-02a06f2977e01a1e",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also sell our Autobend® computer control systems to OEMs of new metal fabrication machine tools that integrate them with their own products prior to the sale of those products to their own customers, to retrofitters of used metal fabrication machine tools that integrate them with those machines as part of the retrofitting operation, and to end-users that have an installed base of metal fabrication machine tools, either with or without related computer control systems.",
        "start_character": 46202,
        "end_character": 46677
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-002512",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-002512-02a06f2977e01a1e",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We design, manufacture, and sell computerized (i.e., Computer Numeric Control (“CNC”)) machine tools, consisting primarily of vertical machining centers (mills) and turning centers (lathes), to companies in the metal cutting industry through a worldwide sales, service, and distribution network.",
        "start_character": 98,
        "end_character": 393
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-002512",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-002512-02a06f2977e01a1e",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have manufactured and sold the Autobend® product line since 1968.",
        "start_character": 33394,
        "end_character": 33462
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-002512",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-002512-02a06f2977e01a1e",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer our products in a range of prices and capabilities to target a broad potential market.",
        "start_character": 48419,
        "end_character": 48514
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-002512",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-002512-02a06f2977e01a1e",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We principally sell our products through approximately 160 independent agents and distributors throughout North and South America (the “Americas”), Europe, and Asia.",
        "start_character": 44619,
        "end_character": 44784
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-002512",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-002512-02a06f2977e01a1e",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We routinely expand our product offerings to meet customer needs, which has led us to design and manufacture more complex machining centers with advanced capabilities.",
        "start_character": 2522,
        "end_character": 2689
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-002512",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-002512-02a06f2977e01a1e",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While the Hurco-branded computer control systems have been, and continue to be, our premium flagship product line, we have added other products to our portfolio that provide product diversity and market penetration opportunity priced from value-tier to high-performance serving a variety of different industries.",
        "start_character": 3772,
        "end_character": 4084
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-002512",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-002512-02a06f2977e01a1e",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Due to leverage of shared resources and cross-utilization of proven engineering designs, we achieve manufacturing efficiency from economies of scale.",
        "start_character": 10311,
        "end_character": 10460
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-002512",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-002512-02a06f2977e01a1e",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Further building on our well-positioned 5-axis lineup, we also completed the design of the BM 500U in fiscal year 2025.",
        "start_character": 20639,
        "end_character": 20758
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-002512",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-002512-02a06f2977e01a1e",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-002512",
        "filing_date": "2026-01-09",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, through our wholly-owned subsidiary LCM, we produce high-value machine tool components and accessories.",
        "start_character": 9849,
        "end_character": 9965
      }
    ]
